 "_why": "What we call our own places, in each language. [SEAN 2026-09-07: 'if it lack of accuratecy read some high volume social media post and learn them.'] What real posts teach is not sentences worth copying, it is WHAT PEOPLE CALL THINGS: a Korean traveller writes the name they would search for, and a translation that invents its own name for a place is one nobody can search and nobody can match to a sign. Register and slang are deliberately NOT copied; this is a licensed guide's voice, and a tour that talks like a comment section reads as unserious. Every entry says where it came from.",
